    "summary": "In the opposing [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes moving, whether its move was **Normal**, an **Advance**, or a **Fall Back**, spend 1 CP on as many as two **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** units of yours no more than 8\" from that enemy unit. Each may move up to 6\" as a **Normal move**. Units in **Engagement Range** of an enemy unit cannot be picked, and a pair needs exactly one member with the **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** keyword, with the two no more than 6\" apart.",
